#: caja-dropbox.in:67
msgid ""
"Dropbox is the easiest way to share and store your files online. Want to "
"learn more? Head to"
msgstr ""
"Dropbox ir vienkāršākais veids, kā koplietot un glabāt failus tiešsaistē. "
"Vēlaties uzzināt vairāk? Apmeklējiet"

#: caja-dropbox.in:69
msgid "In order to use Dropbox, you must download the proprietary daemon."
msgstr "Lai izmantotu Dropbox, jālejupielādē patentētais dēmons."

#: caja-dropbox.in:70
msgid ""
"Note: python-gpg (python-gpgme for Ubuntu 16.10 and lower) is not installed, "
"we will not be able to verify binary signatures."
msgstr ""
"Piezīme: python-gpg (Ubuntu 16.10 un vecākām versijām — python-gpgme) nav "
"instalēts, tāpēc nevarēs pārbaudīt bināro failu parakstus."

#: caja-dropbox.in:71
msgid ""
"Trouble connecting to Dropbox servers. Maybe your internet connection is "
"down, or you need to set your http_proxy environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Neizdodas savienoties ar Dropbox serveriem. Iespējams, nav interneta "
"savienojuma vai jāiestata vides mainīgais http_proxy."

#: caja-dropbox.in:72
msgid "Downloaded binary does not match Dropbox signature, aborting install."
msgstr ""
"Lejupielādētais binārais fails neatbilst Dropbox parakstam; instalēšana tiek "
"pārtraukta."

#: caja-dropbox.in:73
msgid ""
"Could not start the Dropbox daemon. Make sure your computer meets the "
"minimum requirements:\n"
"https://www.dropbox.com/help/desktop-web/system-requirements#desktop"
msgstr ""
"Neizdevās palaist Dropbox dēmonu. Pārliecinieties, vai dators atbilst "
"minimālajām prasībām:\n"
"https://www.dropbox.com/help/desktop-web/system-requirements#desktop"

#: caja-dropbox.in:78
#, c-format
msgid "Downloading Dropbox... %d%%"
msgstr "Lejupielādē Dropbox... %d%%"

#: caja-dropbox.in:79
#, c-format
msgid "Unpacking Dropbox... %d%%"
msgstr "Atspiež Dropbox... %d%%"

#: caja-dropbox.in:451
msgid "Dropbox Installation"
msgstr "Dropbox instalēšana"

#: caja-dropbox.in:512
msgid "_Don't show this again"
msgstr "_Turpmāk to vairs nerādīt"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:3
msgid "Caja Dropbox"
msgstr "Caja Dropbox"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:4
msgid "File Synchronizer For Mate"
msgstr "Failu sinhronizētājs MATE vidē"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:5
msgid "Installs and launches proprietary Dropbox cloud software"
msgstr "Instalē un palaiž patentēto Dropbox mākoņa programmatūru"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:12
msgid "file;synchronization;sharing;collaboration;cloud;storage;backup;"
msgstr ""
